  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-tiny-tomatoes-v7.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "fa71fb81d2961745883c4901d412a95be9622f9e74299bb76ae1aea52ccb50b3",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "734349e4e47fccf2f9a43c28885b9321af416519615be178a2f565e22a97afad",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nTiny Tomatoes",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4f09f2df15a6a11336f0a94c6b6158a6d74155cadc8063787d92905732c58087",
      "text": "Wukong found a sunny spot.\nIt was by his front door.\n“Let’s grow tiny tomatoes!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d76da1995cb649a414049b09d903c3e56ca501cc930106dd9e2faa535ee347d",
      "text": "Ao Bing brought two plants.\nThey dug two little holes.\n“One for you. One for me!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2ee4692301167d0f2e99233d1795e7932f60d521df25219eacda1a84c9ea01b8",
      "text": "They put the plants in.\nPat, pat. They patted the soil.\nWukong patted his tummy, too.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "64bfec685af18dd580523e0e3c656a8d0357fce7406a97cf6aaf637328344671",
      "text": "Wukong tipped his can.\n“A drink for you...”\nOops! A drink for his shoe!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "096fcef8df0c119288311d1b91b9a3b387fa1906e8b41f9bed7e7d0bc5f91a7a",
      "text": "Ao Bing made a tiny cloud. Drip,\ndrip, drip. “Gentle rain!” said\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29f8244c87c4dd7c6aed7fa5e75bdd9d8b2b1bbb39f61943077d4b8eb5b8b8da",
      "text": "Each day, they checked the soil.\nDry? A little drink.\nDamp? Time to play!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c85fa9cef908e44199cc8a7ae848e988981081542658954141297c3ba162755d",
      "text": "“Red yet?” asked Wukong.\nHe looked under the leaves.\nAo Bing found Wukong’s nose!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4d45fc6d1b7ceb28920985803da8f3dfd8f989e3651efdb8d91c685b153a3530",
      "text": "Days went by.\nLittle yellow flowers opened.\n“Hello, tiny stars!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "baf21135d49436276976540e8052b9f787ca321f4976ca37809b1c14425f58d0",
      "text": "Then came tiny green tomatoes.\n“Ready?” asked Wukong.\n“Not yet,” said Ao Bing.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9a763b023bd6a3439943376adef0107611cfb203c2fcf808dfbf1fbaec26e755",
      "text": "“Please turn red!”\nWukong waited. No answer.\nNot even a peep.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2af8172b237a77fd6547fc8dddbc6fdcdad625e76c9840c7c7e9fb977a81b155",
      "text": "They watered. They waited.\nGreen turned to gold.\nGold turned to orange.\n“Almost!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2a38c02888b99e7ff379b20a30f1022eaf0a8517a37e8e8cf178ac31ff59bd85",
      "text": "One morning... red!\nBright, shiny, tomato red!\nWukong did a tiny tomato dance.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5823fdf8fdbeeccb8e9bdadcd28f1d63bb526d497394570e13ce9589f3de8437",
      "text": "Twist, lift, plop.\nThey picked the red ones.\nThe green ones stayed to grow.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7dba900732cdab5fe3e7fae0afa91ebdbb6319164beb642043568035d90c0e24",
      "text": "They washed the tomatoes.\nRed tomatoes. Cool water.\n“Now we can taste them!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a152dc8d36761f971554704ef9697073ede083781d7bdb0959734442e0fda8ea",
      "text": "They shared sweet tomato bites.\n“We grew these,” said Wukong.\nAo Bing smiled. “Together.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
